      "date": "2026-02-16T07:57:46.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.20 (vs ₹0.04 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.20 (up from ₹0.04 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹69.7m (up 73% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹4.05m (up 474% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 5.8% (up from 1.8% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 44% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 18% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
